Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.50,0:03:27.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go，go！Move it，move it！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.10,0:03:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.21,0:03:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Let's go！- There's four of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.41,0:03:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You can count。I'm impressed。Drive。- Rule one：Never change the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.61,0:03:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Deal was transportation for three men with a combined weight of 254 kilos.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.02,0:03:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah？Well，this is a new deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.79,0:03:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,An extra 80 kilos means we won't make it on the gas I allotted.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.52,0:03:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- We'll stop for more gas。- Every stop we make exposes us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.73,0:04:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Every exposure increases the risk of getting caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.73,0:04:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,An extra 80 kilos means the shock absorbers I installed for this job…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.20,0:04:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,won't allow us to outmaneuver any police that might be chasing us，
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.27,0:04:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,which means，if there is a chase，we lose our advantage，
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.88,0:04:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,increasing the chance of getting caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.44,0:04:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't want to get caught。You don't want to get caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.55,0:04:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Drive the car or catch a bullet to the brains！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.95,0:04:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Then who drives？- Shoot this asshole！I drive！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.72,0:04:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not without the ignition code you won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.83,0:04:37.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Three men，254 kilos。That was the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.01,0:04:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Three men。254 kilos。- Seat belts.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.39,0:05:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,See what I mean about the shocks？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.03,0:05:41.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now it's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.17,0:05:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look out！Get out of the way！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.71,0:05:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wrong way！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.85,0:06:02.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop，Marcel，stop！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.76,0:06:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Move away！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.24,0:06:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.68,0:06:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go，go，go！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.68,0:06:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，merde.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.46,0:06:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.10,0:07:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you don't mind，I just conditioned the leather back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.50,0:07:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Take us to the drop point。- Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.52,0:07:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,The cops！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.36,0:07:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you doing？Don't stop now！Do something！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.70,0:07:53.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Come on！- What are you thinking？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.47,0:07:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go！Go！Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.97,0:08:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do it！Now！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.13,0:08:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your gun，please.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.08,0:09:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Police！Stop！Stop！Police！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.75,0:10:00.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You gave me too much。- I need you to take us to Avignon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.59,0:10:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,The deal was this far，no further.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.26,0:10:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,The deal is the deal。Rule number one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.76,0:10:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Rules are meant to be broken。- Not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.60,0:10:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.14,0:10:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get in the car。Come on！Hurry！Move it！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.86,0:11:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where's your yellow card？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.19,0:11:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,I must've left it back in Nam，at the base.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.56,0:11:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,They all say that。Left it in Nam on the base.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.53,0:11:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let me show you what we do to people who forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.73,0:11:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，no，please let go of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.20,0:11:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,You gotta be punished for this。It's a fate far worse than death.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.31,0:11:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，hell。What could be a fate worse than death？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.18,0:11:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Argentinean government commits to meeting the IMF's target this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.19,0:11:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yesterday in Nice，four men robbed the Alliance Investment Corporation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.89,0:11:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,One man died on the sidewalk。The others were apprehended this morning…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.83,0:11:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,when they took a wrong turn on a one-way street in Avignon
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.23,0:11:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,and ran into a taxicab.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.54,0:11:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Police said，were it not for the poor driving，
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.27,0:11:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,the 20 million euros in bearer bonds…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.01,0:12:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,would have been cashed and gone by this afternoon。In other news…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.28,0:12:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,I always say，the way a man treats his car is how he treats himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.52,0:12:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'd say that's probably true，Inspector.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.56,0:12:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have a good sense of humor for a foreigner.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.56,0:12:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Like the French。Sly wit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.10,0:12:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just the right amount of flavor。Been out driving？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.27,0:12:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Till they pass a law says I can't。Want to come in for a coffee？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.57,0:12:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you，but I have a lot of stops to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.71,0:12:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 88，to be exact。- That's a lot of stops.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.65,0:12:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,A lot of 1999 black BMW 735s
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.08,0:12:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,with 0-6 in the license plates to check out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.82,0:12:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a very popular car with a certain type down here。You've seen them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.76,0:12:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,They come over from Italy in very expensive suits，
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.10,0:12:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,and young，pretty girls with big jewelry and too much makeup.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.80,0:12:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Very… Mafia.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.44,0:13:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,There was a robbery。A getaway.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.97,0:13:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Some very fancy driving.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.94,0:13:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Was someone in a 1999 black BMW 735？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.65,0:13:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,With 0-6 in the plates.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.35,0:13:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Have you been to the city lately？- Not for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.79,0:13:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,I love Nice。The food，the way they grill fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.19,0:13:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,No place else in France does it the way they do in Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.63,0:13:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,And the women…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.03,0:13:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,I prefer the women there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.47,0:13:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,They are more… complicated
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.20,0:13:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,than the local variety，don't you think？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.78,0:13:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I don't particularly like complicated。- You like to keep it simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.35,0:13:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Why are you so interested？- Oh，you know，
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.38,0:13:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,ever since I'm a little boy，military people have intrigued me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.99,0:13:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm ex-military。- I am an ex-little boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.40,0:14:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sure you don't have time for a coffee？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.17,0:14:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everything's always so neat with you，Monsieur Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.14,0:14:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Nothing ever out of place。- I'll take that as a compliment，
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.74,0:14:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,coming from a man who pays attention to every detail.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.22,0:14:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll come back later for that coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.39,0:14:27.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Door's always open to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.57,0:14:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hugo gave me your number。- Be brief.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.87,0:14:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I need a transporter。- I'm listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.05,0:14:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- One bag，that's it。- Dimensions？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.52,0:14:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Be specific。- One meter 50 by a half meter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.56,0:15:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Weight。- 50 kilos，not more.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.93,0:15:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Destination？- 24，rue de Luxembourg.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.10,0:15:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You're delivering to Mr… - Rule two：No names.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.07,0:15:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Time of pickup？- Seven in the morning，at the front door.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.48,0:15:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,A package。150 by 50，50 kilos，250 kilometers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.12,0:15:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Traveling within the speed limit，one stop for refreshments：40，000.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.62,0:15:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Half now，half on delivery。Delivery will be at noon。If no one's there，
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.79,0:15:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not responsible。I'll leave the package.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.16,0:15:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Once we make a deal，it cannot be changed or renegotiated.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.96,0:15:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Another rule？- That's rule number one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.00,0:15:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do we have a deal？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.68,0:15:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You're very precise。- Transportation is a precise business.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.08,0:17:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Flat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.02,0:19:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't move。I won't hurt you，I'll just make a hole so you can drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.16,0:19:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please。Please，come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.21,0:19:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on。Drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.88,0:19:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.00,0:20:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK，OK，that's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.37,0:20:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.31,0:20:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll take the tape off。If you scream，I'll have to kill you。Understand？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.15,0:20:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have to pee.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.25,0:21:02.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,You want me to do it in your car？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.39,0:21:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.90,0:21:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm gonna take my knife out，so don't scream，OK？It's to cut you free.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.31,0:21:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't need your mouth to pee.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.82,0:21:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have one minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.46,0:21:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,55，54，53，52…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.80,0:21:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Breaking the rules，Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.04,0:21:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not good to break the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.38,0:22:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,15！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.65,0:22:11.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.19,0:22:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Two。Time's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.80,0:22:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't make me drag you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.71,0:22:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.02,0:23:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，please！No.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.69,0:23:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Rule three：Never look in the package.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.13,0:23:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hope you enjoyed your pee cos it's your last on this trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.96,0:24:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,See what comes of breaking the rules？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.18,0:24:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You're late。- Ran into a little problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.88,0:24:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nothin' serious？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.72,0:24:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nothin' serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.17,0:25:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You open the package？- Rule three：Never open the package.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.67,0:25:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,I like that。Rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.21,0:25:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can't get anything done in a world without rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.65,0:25:29.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're a foreigner，right？Nice little thing you've got going for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.32,0:25:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,High class… good reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.72,0:25:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I didn't get your name。- Rule two：No names.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.06,0:25:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.11,0:25:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't count it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.74,0:25:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why？Should I？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.01,0:26:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No，no。- That concludes the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.39,0:26:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，I was wondering
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.09,0:26:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,if you wouldn't mind transporting something for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.43,0:26:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's what you do，right？You deliver，no questions asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.77,0:26:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why not？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.71,0:26:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Weight？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.91,0:26:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Maybe a kilo。- Destination？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.15,0:26:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Grenoble。306，rue de Lac。A Mr…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.32,0:26:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，right。I forgot。Rule two.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.48,0:27:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,I like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.71,0:28:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the f？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.91,0:29:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where is he？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.92,0:31:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're like dogshit。You're everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.79,0:31:48.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。I know you wanna pee。All you wanna do is pee.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.06,0:32:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Useless piece of shit！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.21,0:33:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,I ask the questions，you answer them.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.88,0:33:51.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,No long speeches，just keep it simple。Got it？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.36,0:34:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Who are you？- My name is Lai。I come from Jap…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.60,0:34:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,I ask the questions，you answer them。Nothing more，nothing less.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.93,0:34:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,You wanna try again？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.24,0:34:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What kind of shit am I in？- Deep shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.71,0:34:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Very deep shit。Those guys… Sorry。I won't say any…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.11,0:34:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bon appetit.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.88,0:34:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Where are you going？- To bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.38,0:34:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can't think straight when I'm tired。Good night's sleep，I see things better.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.75,0:35:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Can I leave？- Be my guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.27,0:37:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey。Are you comfortable？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.78,0:37:04.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Boss… - Sh。Save your strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.08,0:37:08.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just tell me：Who did this？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.55,0:37:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- The transporter。- The transporter's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.72,0:37:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.43,0:37:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,You believe me？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.27,0:37:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,I believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.30,0:37:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,And the police… they were here？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.78,0:37:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You told 'em nothing，right？- Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.28,0:37:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.78,0:37:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,You couldn't talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.92,0:37:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's keep it that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.32,0:38:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,I picked them from the garden outside。I hope you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.39,0:39:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,I didn't know if you like coffee or tea，so I made both.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.74,0:39:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,I hope you like… madeleines.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.85,0:39:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Try one.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.82,0:39:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Careful。It's hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.99,0:39:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.07,0:39:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.10,0:39:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I like it quiet in the morning。- Yes，quiet in the morning。Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.24,0:39:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm the same way。I like very quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.05,0:39:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.42,0:40:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you looking for milk？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.26,0:40:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- There's milk at the door。- Stay，stay。I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.57,0:40:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- And you are？- The new cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.88,0:40:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is Monsieur Frank in？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.88,0:40:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ah，Monsieur Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.95,0:40:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Is your invitation for coffee still open？- Sure，come on，please。Sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.16,0:40:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Madeleine？- Homemade？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.42,0:40:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes。I'll bring some more.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.33,0:40:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,My mother made fresh madeleines every morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.10,0:40:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I smell them and my whole childhood comes back in one big flood.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.47,0:40:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Like Proust。You ever read Proust，Monsieur Frank？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.84,0:40:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No。- It's fantastic。Memory like a steel trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.58,0:40:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,He would've been a great cop。Real determined.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.41,0:41:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Milk？- Please，milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.58,0:41:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.49,0:41:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,I used to have a memory like Proust，like a filing cabinet up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.36,0:41:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'd see something and remember it like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.16,0:41:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Like license plates。I could see a plate
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.66,0:41:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,and it was printed in my head。Now I need all the help I can get
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.00,0:41:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,remembering whose plate goes with whose car.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.14,0:41:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Like this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.64,0:41:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- That's mine。- Ah，memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.88,0:41:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- So？Where's the rest of the car？- I was hoping you could tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.22,0:41:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It was stolen。- Stolen？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.99,0:41:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,I went to Frejus to pick up a few things.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.99,0:41:44.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- When I came out of the market，it was… - Gone。Did you report it？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.33,0:41:47.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was the first on my list of things to do today.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.16,0:41:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a long walk from Frejus。How did you get home？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.73,0:41:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,I brought him.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.87,0:41:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,I saw him walking along the dark road.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.70,0:42:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,A risky thing，picking up a stranger on a dark road.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.58,0:42:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,He had a kind face.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.81,0:42:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I didn't see a car outside。- It's in the garage.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.85,0:42:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,May I see it？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.91,0:42:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pretty nice car for a cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.38,0:42:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Some people have a problem with the Germans.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.68,0:42:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,They are too aggressive，they take up the best beaches in summer，
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.25,0:42:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,they can't cook worth a damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.72,0:42:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,I say，anyone makes such great cars can't be all bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.20,0:42:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I would say you should work out very well for Monsieur Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.20,0:43:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Work out for both of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.08,0:43:12.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,My intuition says this is probably a good time for me to go file my report.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.65,0:43:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Where's the rest of my car？- Oh，yes，I almost forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.59,0:43:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was blown to pieces at a rest stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.82,0:43:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's left of it is down at the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.23,0:43:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,They are trying to separate what was left of the two cops in the trunk from the rest of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.07,0:43:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,But you wouldn't know anything about that？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.10,0:43:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No。- Sorry to interrupt.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.14,0:43:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Thank you for the coffee and the memories。- Come back anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.34,0:43:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Would you mind walking me？- No.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.18,0:43:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have always been very quiet about your business。I appreciate that.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.95,0:43:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,This business at the rest stop，it's not very quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.19,0:44:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Would you like to tell me something besides the stolen-car story？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.49,0:44:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,If I had one，I would.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.16,0:44:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,May I suggest that when the two of you show up in my office after lunch，
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.83,0:44:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,that you have one，a better one than you currently have.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.31,0:44:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are the one he wants to see，not me！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.12,0:44:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Quiet！Please。I have to think。- You were supposed to think last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.72,0:44:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Last night I had nightmares.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.52,0:44:33.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,About a girl who came into my nice，quiet life，screwed it all up.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.49,0:44:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everything she touched broke and every move became a catastrophe.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.00,0:44:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK，sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.00,0:44:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm still wondering if I want to know everything or nothing about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.92,0:44:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What？- It's the quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.39,0:45:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,I thought you liked quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.86,0:45:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not this quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.05,0:45:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,You OK？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.05,0:45:29.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No。- Good。Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.06,0:45:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go，go，go！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.41,0:45:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，don't stay there！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.60,0:46:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Give me your hand！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.09,0:46:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.36,0:46:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，get in！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.79,0:46:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get in！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.96,0:47:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lai，look，hang on。Do you wanna die？Get in！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.79,0:47:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Calm down，OK？Don't worry。You OK？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.03,0:47:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Stay here。I'll be right back。- No。Wait！Wait！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.98,0:47:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Put it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.92,0:48:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,You OK？Sure？OK，let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.19,0:49:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Frank？Is this your house？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.63,0:49:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.11,0:50:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,I should mind my own goddamn business.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.88,0:50:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Simple rule，simple little rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.99,0:50:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's gotta be some dry clothes in this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.06,0:50:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't open the package.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.79,0:50:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nothin' but trouble，you open the goddamn package.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.03,0:50:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Frank？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.80,0:50:32.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What are you doing？- Making up for the trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.71,0:50:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Wait，wait。Why are you making… - No more questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.82,0:50:46.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait。I don't like it when things get complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.89,0:50:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,You like things simple。Very simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.51,0:51:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not so clear about the house。Could you explain one more time？After I left…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.08,0:51:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,We walked on the beach，had a swim.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.02,0:51:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Where？- Past the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.79,0:51:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Anyone else swimming？- No。Did you see anybody else swimming？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.22,0:51:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no one.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.39,0:51:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，you took a walk，
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.36,0:51:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,had a swim on a beach where no one else was swimming，
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.13,0:51:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,past the point where you can't see or be seen from the beach on either side，
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.27,0:51:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,which makes witnesses a little hard to come by.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.24,0:51:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's the point of a romantic swim。Who wants witnesses？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.38,0:51:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- And then？- We came back to the house，found it on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.79,0:51:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Just like that？On fire？- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.89,0:51:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,The 5，000 rounds of spent ammo my men found all around the house？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.96,0:52:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Maybe they had the wrong house。- Monsieur Frank，
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.26,0:52:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,people with this kind of firepower
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.10,0:52:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,do not make mistakes about who they visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.10,0:52:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Who would want you this dead？- I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.07,0:52:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Any problems with a client？- I don't have clients。I'm retired.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.11,0:52:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,I live on my army pension，you know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.81,0:52:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,You've had the facts of who I am and who I was for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.62,0:52:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Any enemies you can think of？People from the past？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.65,0:52:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,I left the past behind when I moved here.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.66,0:52:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,A past like yours you never leave behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.26,0:52:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Commissaire，on vous demande en bas。- I'll just be a moment。Don't leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.85,0:52:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What are you doing？- Computers know everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.52,0:52:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You just need a password。- Are you nuts？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.79,0:53:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- We're in a police station。- You always complain，
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.16,0:53:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,except when we make love。Then you say nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.09,0:53:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello。See？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.34,0:53:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- So，where will you be staying？- I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.11,0:53:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，my cousin has a small hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.88,0:54:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Thanks，but we'll manage。- Without money？It will be hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.22,0:54:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here。It's not much，but at least you won't go hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.09,0:54:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.40,0:54:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Where are you going？- To see that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.64,0:54:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Good luck。- One moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.24,0:54:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You're not coming？- No.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.98,0:54:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- But he blew up your car。- I'll buy a new one.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.05,0:54:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- He burned your house。- I'll rebuild it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.75,0:54:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- He tried to kill you。- As far as he knows，he succeeded.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.99,0:54:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Some advice… I don't know what you're into，but whoever wanted you dead thinks you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.06,0:54:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have a free pass to start over。Here's the advice：Start over！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.97,0:55:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,There are 400 people dying in a container on a ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.51,0:55:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,My father.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.85,0:55:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,My sisters.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.12,0:55:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,The ship arrives today.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.15,0:55:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,They will make my father a slave.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.29,0:55:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,The only one who knows the container number is that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.63,0:55:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You're very good。- What do you mean？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.93,0:55:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,From the moment you saw those pictures in my house，you set me up to get involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.50,0:55:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Breakfast，giving the excuse to the cop to help me，one lie after another.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.84,0:55:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Not everything is a lie。- Name one thing that isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.95,0:55:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,What happened in the house between us，
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.22,0:55:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,that was not a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.06,0:55:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,You were a soldier。Yourjob was to save people.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.30,0:56:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Past tense。- What does that mean？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.20,0:56:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got tired of seeing my best efforts turned into bullshit
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.31,0:56:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,by the same people who pay me to do the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.14,0:56:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No one cared。- This time，I care.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.50,0:56:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.21,0:56:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Bonjour。- Bonjour.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.01,0:56:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,No phone calls for half an hour？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.05,0:56:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello。Surprise！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.09,0:56:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.47,0:57:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Put your hands where I can see 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.40,0:57:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Before we get to the heart of the matter，
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.91,0:57:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have a question：Why'd you try to kill me？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.54,0:57:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,You lied to me。You opened the package.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.61,0:57:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,You broke the rules，your rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.95,0:57:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did you expect me to recommend you for anotherjob？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.09,0:57:30.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's the ship number？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.39,0:57:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr Transporter，we can both agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.66,0:57:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,I answered your first question politely。I won't answer any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.63,0:57:42.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,So I suggest you kill me right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.14,0:57:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,And go screw yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.68,0:57:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't find anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.35,0:57:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，poor Frank。What'd she tell you？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.09,0:58:02.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're smuggling people in containers？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.76,0:58:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Lai's the perfect name for her。- Mr Kwai's on the way up.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.79,0:58:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your father's here。He'll get a kick out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.03,0:58:13.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I thought your father was in a container。- Yes。I mean，no.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.97,0:58:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,There are 400 people in that container.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.10,0:58:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Stay where you are！- She's a real heartbreaker，isn't she？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.65,0:58:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ten seconds，two choices。The information，or your brains on the desk.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.32,0:58:32.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Now tell me I'm lying！Nine… eight… - Lai，give me the gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.29,0:58:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.16,0:58:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Five… four… three… two…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.19,0:58:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,One。Shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.67,0:58:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lai.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.64,0:58:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Liar？- Would I kill my own daughter，Lai？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.75,0:59:04.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on now。Put it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.06,0:59:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'll talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.76,0:59:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,She thinks we're smuggling people in containers.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.90,0:59:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Where do you get these ideas？- Stay away！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.67,0:59:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Could you kill your own father？- Please，I am begging you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.41,0:59:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Stop what you are doing。- I do what I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.91,0:59:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,I am who I am。I'll never change.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.28,0:59:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,So if you're going to kill me，kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.25,0:59:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,But if you don't，get this gun out of my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.56,0:59:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Give me。- No！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.36,0:59:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know he's innocent。Oh，you have such a good heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.77,0:59:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Always interested in saving innocent people。Well，here's your big chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.97,1:00:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Drop your gun and you will save one.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.28,1:00:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Kill him！- No！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.58,1:00:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- The police are coming。- What now？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.75,1:00:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take her.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.12,1:00:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Send in Leo。I need him to wrap something up.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.58,1:00:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,There were 400 people in that container.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.75,1:00:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Only 395 made it here alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.65,1:00:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Frank！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.79,1:00:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Inspector。Am I glad you're here。- What is this？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.26,1:00:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,This man used my partner's daughter to try and blackmail us.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.03,1:00:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Luckily my security got the drop on him.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.50,1:01:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want to press charges：Kidnapping，extortion，assault.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.14,1:01:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I know this man。- I suppose in your business，
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.14,1:01:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,you have to know all types.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.61,1:01:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Now should I call my lawyer？- We'll handle it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.32,1:01:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll expect all of you at my office for your statements.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.82,1:01:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,As soon as I contact my lawyer，we'll be more than happy to oblige.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.31,1:01:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,The doctor said you'll have a headache，
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.65,1:01:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- then you'll go back to normal。- Where are they？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.89,1:01:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think you should be more concerned with where you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.83,1:02:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,What got into you？You were always so careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.00,1:02:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I've got to get out of here。- The charges are filed.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.33,1:02:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,You will not be getting out for a very long time.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.24,1:02:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Assaulting a distinguished member of the business community，
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.24,1:02:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,kidnapping his daughter，extortion…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.74,1:02:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry，Frank。I would like to help you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.88,1:02:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,But if you continue with the same old story：I'm retired，living on a pension…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.26,1:02:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,I need fresh，Frank。I need new.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.93,1:02:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,For once，I need the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.43,1:02:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK。They're smuggling people，from Asia，
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.37,1:02:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,through Marseilles，in containers.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.07,1:02:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You know this for a fact？- The girl told me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.61,1:02:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You believe her？- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.88,1:02:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,In French，we have a saying：Never believe the cook.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.05,1:03:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- She's not the cook。- Oh。I suspected.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.06,1:03:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No one is perfect。- You're saying you'll do nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.59,1:03:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm saying I'm going to start an investigation.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.60,1:03:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,400 people could be dead already.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.60,1:03:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,But what am I supposed to do？There are laws.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.64,1:03:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Sometimes you make your own law。- Like you do？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.41,1:03:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,It doesn't take me 12 months to do the job.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.74,1:03:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，yes，I know。That's what I admire about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.78,1:03:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,All that army training，all that sneaking around…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.78,1:03:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,A man like you could probably resolve this case in how long？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.52,1:03:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 12 hours？- Less.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.76,1:03:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Less。Impressive.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.43,1:03:43.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,You'd be the perfect man for the job.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.76,1:03:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yes。If I were out。- Yes。If you were out.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.89,1:04:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Anybody moves and I kill him.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.66,1:04:53.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,If this is how you transport，I'm amazed you get any work at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.27,1:04:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，give me a hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.28,1:05:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Maybe I should go with you？- Thanks，but I'm better alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.35,1:05:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,That is a very small boat to fight a very big war.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.22,1:05:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。But it's a good boat.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.02,1:05:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Frank，here.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.06,1:05:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,You'll need it.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.80,1:05:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Or maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.55,1:06:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shipment is cleared。Here's the paperwork.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.29,1:07:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take the highway all the way to the first exit，Lyon.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.19,1:07:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go straight to the warehouse。We'll be right behind you，just in case.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.88,1:07:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK，we are ready to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.59,1:07:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lai，dear…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.20,1:07:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,I spent thousands of dollars for you to go to school and learn English.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.40,1:07:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- The least you can do is speak it。- I hate you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.68,1:07:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm still your father.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.85,1:07:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get her out of here！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.04,1:08:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Give me a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.93,1:08:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Keep him alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.54,1:09:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.60,1:10:30.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，don't！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.11,1:10:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.46,1:17:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bitch！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.77,1:17:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good morning。You lost？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.44,1:17:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm lookin' to do a little sightseeing。- This plane is not for tourists.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.68,1:17:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not a tourist.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.04,1:18:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Call this guy and tell him to meet me.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.41,1:18:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sure。Where？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.38,1:18:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Down there.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.51,1:18:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.26,1:19:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Move up.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.76,1:20:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.13,1:22:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get closer.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.54,1:22:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Steady。- No，Dad，no！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.61,1:22:22.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get away！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.83,1:23:50.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Down！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.65,1:24:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hands on your head。Move！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.02,1:24:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Watch her。If she moves or I don't return，shoot her.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.26,1:24:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- To the water。- I'm really not in the mood for a swim.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.83,1:24:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,March！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.67,1:24:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,So how did a lowlife like you end up with my daughter？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.04,1:24:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Found her in a bag，where you left her。- You know nothing。Move！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.78,1:24:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,You got involved with the wrong girl，you dumbshit.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.72,1:24:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,The delivery will be made，my daughter will get over it.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.25,1:24:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,If I'm lucky，maybe she'll see the light.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.26,1:24:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,If she's lucky，maybe you'll get hit by a truck.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.97,1:24:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What do you know？- She'll never stop being who she is.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.74,1:24:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,She'll never be you or anything like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.97,1:25:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,She'll come around。But you won't be here to see it.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.78,1:25:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.65,1:25:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,I guess she won't be coming around after all.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.99,1:25:22.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Turn around！- I'd rather see it coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.96,1:25:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Makes no difference to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.52,1:25:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,He was a bastard，but he was still my father.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.21,1:26:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pretty impressive timing，Frank.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.15,1:26:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,I guess I underestimated you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.00,0:01:38.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,《非常人贩》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.50,0:03:27.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 走 走！快！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.10,0:03:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,走啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.21,0:03:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点！- 一共四个人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.41,0:03:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你懂算术嘛 不简单 开车！- 规则一：不能改变约定
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.61,0:03:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,约定好运送三人总重254公斤
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.02,0:03:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,破坏约定又怎么样！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.79,0:03:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,额外的80公斤意味着 我准备的汽油到不了目的地
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.52,0:03:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那就停下来加油啊！- 每停一次车就曝一次光
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.73,0:04:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,多曝光一次就多一分被捕风险
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.73,0:04:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,额外的80公斤 使得我精心调校的哥尼避震器
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.20,0:04:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,无法确保甩掉追来的警车
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.27,0:04:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说… 展开追逐战 我们讨不到便宜
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.88,0:04:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,被逮的可能性也跟着升高
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.44,0:04:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想被逮 你们也不想被逮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.55,0:04:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,安静开车 不然脑袋准备开花
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.95,0:04:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那谁来开车？- 杀了这罗嗦鬼 我来开！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.72,0:04:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有启动密码开不了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.83,0:04:37.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,三个人 254公斤 事前约定好的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.01,0:04:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 三个人254公斤 - 安全带系紧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.39,0:05:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,了解我说的避震效果了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.03,0:05:41.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,时候到了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.17,0:05:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,让路！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.71,0:05:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,走错了 逆向！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.85,0:06:02.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们逆向行驶！马塞尔停车！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.76,0:06:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 让开！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.24,0:06:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,爽！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.68,0:06:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！快！快！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.68,0:06:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,呸！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.46,0:06:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.10,0:07:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 皮椅刚保养过
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.50,0:07:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 带我们到交货地点 - 还不行
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.52,0:07:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,条子！条子！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.36,0:07:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要停车 想点办法！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.70,0:07:53.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点 想办法 - 你还在想什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.47,0:07:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,开车
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.97,0:08:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,加速 马索
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.13,0:08:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻烦枪借我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.08,0:09:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察！不许动！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.52,0:09:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我受够飞车追逐了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.19,0:09:33.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们走吧 还等什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.75,0:10:00.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你付太多钱了 - 请你带我们到亚维农
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.59,0:10:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,约定送到这里为止 不行
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.26,0:10:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,约定就是约定 务必遵守
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.76,0:10:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有约定必有违约 - 我不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.60,0:10:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.14,0:10:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,上车
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.86,0:11:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的证件呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.19,0:11:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定是把它留在越南的军营了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.56,0:11:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,留在军营里 他们都是这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.53,0:11:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你看看我们怎么对待 那些忘记它的人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.73,0:11:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 请你放我走
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.20,0:11:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应有此报 这命运比死还惨
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.31,0:11:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 有什么会比死还惨？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.18,0:11:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿根廷政府决意要在今年 达到国际货币基金会订的目标
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.19,0:11:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨日… 四名歹徒洗劫尼斯的亚联投资
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.89,0:11:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中一名死于人行道 其他三名亦已在今晨落网
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.83,0:11:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们于亚维农因违规转弯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.23,0:11:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,而撞上计程车
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.54,0:11:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,警方表示 若非他们驾驶习惯不良
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.27,0:11:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,价值二千万欧圆的债券
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.01,0:12:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,会在今天下午之前被盗领一空
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.28,0:12:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我常说 待车如待人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.52,0:12:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相当同意 警官
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.56,0:12:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,难得你这个外国人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.56,0:12:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂法式幽默 法兰克先生
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.10,0:12:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,会心一笑 恰到好处 出去飙车？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.27,0:12:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非修法禁止 要不要进来喝杯咖啡？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.57,0:12:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了 还有很多车要检查
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.71,0:12:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 88辆 正确的说 - 的确相当多
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.65,0:12:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,有不少1999年份…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.08,0:12:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑色BMW735车牌是06的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.82,0:12:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,本区某些人很喜欢这款车 你该看过
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.76,0:12:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们穿着高级西装 从意大利过来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.10,0:12:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,年轻女孩珠光宝气 浓妆艳抹
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.80,0:12:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,十足的黑手党
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.44,0:13:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了一起抢案… 开车脱逃
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.97,0:13:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,驾驶技术很炫
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.94,0:13:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,开1999年黑色BMW735
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.65,0:13:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,车牌是06开头的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.35,0:13:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 最近有进城吗？- 没有
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.79,0:13:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢尼斯 食物 烤鱼很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.19,0:13:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,全法国独一无二
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.63,0:13:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及女人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.03,0:13:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢那边的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.47,0:13:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们比较…复杂…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.20,0:13:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,相较于其他地区 你同意吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.78,0:13:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不太喜欢复杂 - 你喜欢单纯？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.35,0:13:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你为什么这么有兴趣？- 噢 你知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.38,0:13:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,打从小时候开始 军人一直很吸引我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.99,0:13:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是退伍军人 - 我是童年不再
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.40,0:14:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,确定不喝咖啡？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.17,0:14:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远有条不紊 法兰克先生
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.14,0:14:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 随时井然有序 - 我当这句是恭维话
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.74,0:14:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,出自钜细靡遗观察家之口
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.22,0:14:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我晚点过来喝杯咖啡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.39,0:14:27.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,随时欢迎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.57,0:14:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 鲁波给我你的电话号码 - 有话请直说
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.87,0:14:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我在找快递高手 - 我在听
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.05,0:14:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 只送一个袋子 - 大小？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.52,0:14:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请给我正确数字 - 长一米半 宽半米
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.56,0:15:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 重量？- 50公斤 就这样
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.93,0:15:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 目的地？- 卢森堡街24号
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.10,0:15:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 送去给… - 规则二：不提姓名
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.07,0:15:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 提货时间？- 早上七点 大门口
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.48,0:15:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,包裹一件 长一米半 宽半米 50公斤 距离250公里
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.12,0:15:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不必超速 中途休息一次 四万法郎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.62,0:15:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,事前后各付一半中午交货 如果没人领货
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.79,0:15:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我的责任 我会直接丢下包裹
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.16,0:15:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦达成协议 内容不能更动
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.96,0:15:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 又是一条规则？- 这是规则一
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.00,0:15:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,同不同意？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.68,0:15:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你非常精确 - 快递是精确的行业
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.08,0:17:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,爆胎！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.02,0:19:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要动 我不会伤害妳 只是帮妳割个洞让妳喝点东西
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.16,0:19:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 不要动！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.21,0:19:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.88,0:19:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢慢来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.00,0:20:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.37,0:20:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,乖
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.31,0:20:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我帮妳把胶带拿掉 妳叫我会杀了妳 懂吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.15,0:20:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要上厕所！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.25,0:21:02.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要我尿在车子里？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.39,0:21:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.90,0:21:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我有刀 不要叫 我帮妳松绑
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.31,0:21:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,尿尿不用嘴巴
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.82,0:21:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,一分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.46,0:21:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,五十五…五十四…五十三…五十二…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.80,0:21:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在破坏规矩 法兰克
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.04,0:21:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,破坏规矩不好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.38,0:22:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,十五！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.65,0:22:11.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,七…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.19,0:22:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,二… 时间到
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.80,0:22:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要我用拉的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.71,0:22:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.02,0:23:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要！拜托！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.69,0:23:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,规则三：绝不看包裹
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.13,0:23:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,尿干净了吧 下不为例
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.96,0:24:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到破坏规矩的后果了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.18,0:24:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你迟到了 - 碰到一些小问题
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.88,0:24:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不严重吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.72,0:24:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不严重
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.17,0:25:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你开过包裹吗？- 规则三：绝不看包裹
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.67,0:25:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢 守规矩
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.21,0:25:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有规矩 万事行不通
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.65,0:25:29.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是外国人吧？你这小买卖做得很出色
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.32,0:25:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,高级 声誉卓著
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.72,0:25:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还不知道你的大名 - 规则二：不提姓名
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.06,0:25:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.11,0:25:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不数一数？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.74,0:25:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？需要吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.01,0:26:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 交易完成
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.39,0:26:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在想…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.09,0:26:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能不能帮我送个东西？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.43,0:26:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的工作吧？只负责送 不提问题
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.77,0:26:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,送东西没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.71,0:26:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,重量？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.91,0:26:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可能有一公斤 - 目的地？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.15,0:26:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛诺柏市 拉克路306号 一位先生叫…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.32,0:26:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 差点忘记 规则二
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.48,0:27:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢他
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.71,0:28:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么鬼…？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.91,0:29:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.92,0:31:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,出来 妳真是阴魂不散
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.79,0:31:48.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,又要上厕所？有完没完？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.06,0:32:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,法兰克 你这猪头！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.21,0:33:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我问问题 妳负责回答
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.88,0:33:51.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,简单扼要 不要废话 懂吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.36,0:34:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妳是谁？- 我姓赖 来自…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.60,0:34:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我问问题 妳负责回答 不必多说 不能少说
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.93,0:34:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,想再试一次吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.24,0:34:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我惹上了什么麻烦？- 大麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.71,0:34:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,超级大 他们… 对不起 我不再废话…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.11,0:34:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你胃口好
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.88,0:34:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你去哪里？- 睡觉
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.38,0:34:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,一累我就头昏脑胀 睡好觉 问题就能迎刃而解
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.75,0:35:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我可以走了吗？- 请便
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.27,0:37:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,舒服吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.78,0:37:04.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 老大… - 省点力气吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.08,0:37:08.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我说 谁干的？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.55,0:37:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 送快递的 - 送快递的死了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.72,0:37:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没死
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.43,0:37:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.27,0:37:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信你
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.30,0:37:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察呢？来过吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.78,0:37:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没跟他们说什么吧？- 没有
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.28,0:37:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.78,0:37:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能说出去
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.92,0:37:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好永远都说不了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.32,0:38:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面花园摘的 你不介意吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.39,0:39:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道你喜欢茶还是咖啡 所以两种都准备了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.74,0:39:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你喜欢… 玛德琳蛋糕
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.85,0:39:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃吃看
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.82,0:39:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心 很烫
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.99,0:39:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吃吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.07,0:39:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.10,0:39:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我喜欢宁静的早晨 - 宁静的早晨 我也喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.24,0:39:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你一样 我喜欢一片宁静
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.05,0:39:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.42,0:40:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,找牛奶吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.26,0:40:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 门口有牛奶 - 你坐 我去拿
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.57,0:40:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妳是？- 新厨师
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.88,0:40:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,法兰克先生在吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.88,0:40:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,法兰克先生
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.95,0:40:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喝咖啡的邀请还有效吗？- 当然 请进 坐
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.16,0:40:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 玛德琳蛋糕？- 自己做的？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.42,0:40:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我再去拿
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.33,0:40:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈妈以前天天早上亲手做
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.10,0:40:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这味道让我想起小时候
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.47,0:40:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像普鲁斯特 你读过吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.84,0:40:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没 - 写得很棒 回忆历历在目
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.58,0:40:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很适合当警察 观察力超强
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.41,0:41:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 加牛奶吗？- 加
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.58,0:41:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.49,0:41:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前我的记忆力不输普鲁斯特 脑袋像个资料库
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.36,0:41:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,轻易就过目不忘
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.16,0:41:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如…车牌号码
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.66,0:41:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,看过就烙印在脑海里 现在不查资料
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.00,0:41:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,就弄不清楚谁的车牌几号
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.14,0:41:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好比…这一块
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.64,0:41:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它是我的 - 过去式了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.88,0:41:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 车子的其他部份哪去了？- 我正等着你告诉我呢
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.22,0:41:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 被偷了 - 被偷了？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.99,0:41:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到菲宿港买点东西
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.99,0:41:44.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 从市场出来 它就… - 不翼而飞？你报过案吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.33,0:41:47.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备今天一早去报案
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.16,0:41:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,菲宿离这很远 怎么回来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.73,0:41:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我载他回来的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.87,0:41:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看他走在黑漆漆的路上
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.70,0:42:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑暗中载陌生人很危险
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.58,0:42:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的脸不像坏人
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.81,0:42:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我没看到外面有车子 - 在车库里
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.85,0:42:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以看看吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.91,0:42:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,厨师开这种车真奢侈
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.38,0:42:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些人不喜欢德国人
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.68,0:42:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,太招摇了 夏天占据整座沙滩
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.25,0:42:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,饮食品味令人不敢恭维
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.72,0:42:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我说做得出这种好车的民族 不可能一无可取
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.20,0:42:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,妳对法兰克的直觉很准
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.20,0:43:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是相看两不厌
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.08,0:43:12.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的直觉告诉我该回去写报告
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.65,0:43:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我车子的其他部份呢？- 差点忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.59,0:43:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,在休息站炸得粉碎
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.82,0:43:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,残骸在局里的化验室
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.23,0:43:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们正努力将两名警察的尸块 从残骸里挑出来
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.07,0:43:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了 反正你不知情
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.10,0:43:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 打扰了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.14,0:43:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多谢你的咖啡和记忆 - 欢迎随时再来
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.34,0:43:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可以陪我走走吗？- 不
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.18,0:43:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做事一向不张扬 法兰克 感谢你为局里省掉很多麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.95,0:43:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,但休息站的事太嚣张了 除了车子被偷之外
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.19,0:44:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能透露点别的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.49,0:44:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果知道 我一定告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.16,0:44:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,午饭后麻烦两位到局里走一趟
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.83,0:44:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望到时你能谈点别的 换个比较有内容的版本
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.31,0:44:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是来找你的 不是我
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.12,0:44:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 安静！我得仔细想想 - 昨晚你就该先想清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.72,0:44:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 可是我昨晚恶梦连连
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.52,0:44:33.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个女孩闯进我的宁静生活 搞得我不得安宁
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.49,0:44:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,她碰过的东西不是坏就是毁
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.00,0:44:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.00,0:44:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道该徹底了解妳 还是该保持一无所知
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.92,0:44:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么啦？- 好安静
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.39,0:45:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是喜欢安静吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.86,0:45:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,静得出奇
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.05,0:45:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,妳还好吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.05,0:45:29.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不好 - 很好 走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.06,0:45:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.41,0:45:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要待在那里！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.60,0:46:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,手给我！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.09,0:46:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 进去 进去！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.36,0:46:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.79,0:46:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.96,0:47:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,赖 快点！妳不想活啦？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.79,0:47:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去！冷静点好吗？不用担心 妳还好吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.03,0:47:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 留在这里 我马上回来 - 等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.98,0:47:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴上
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.92,0:48:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以吗？确定？我们走
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.19,0:49:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的家吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.63,0:49:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,算是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.11,0:50:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么要多管闲事！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.88,0:50:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,规矩 简单的规矩
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.99,0:50:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,房子里一定有… 干衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.06,0:50:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝不可打开包裹
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.79,0:50:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开保证后患无穷
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.03,0:50:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,法兰克？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.80,0:50:32.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妳在干嘛？- 想报答你
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.71,0:50:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等等 为什么要报答… - 别再问了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.82,0:50:46.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我不想越弄越复杂
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.89,0:50:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢单纯 很简单啊
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.51,0:51:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,房子出了什么事 请解释一下 再说一次 我离开后…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.08,0:51:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你走后 我们去散步 游泳
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.02,0:51:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说在哪儿游泳？- 海角另一边
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.79,0:51:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当时有别人在游泳吗？- 没有 妳有看到别人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.22,0:51:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 一个都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.39,0:51:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以…你们去散步
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.36,0:51:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后游泳 在空无一人的海边
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.13,0:51:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,在海角那边 看不到别人 别人也看不到你们
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.27,0:51:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以不太可能有目击者
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.24,0:51:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里好浪漫 谁想被看到？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.38,0:51:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 然后呢？- 然后回去 发现房子着火了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.79,0:51:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 无缘无故起火？- 对
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.89,0:51:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,现场五千枚爆炸过的弹药 你怎么解释？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.96,0:52:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 或许是他们认错了房子 - 法兰克先生
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.26,0:52:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,拥有这种火力的人
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.10,0:52:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能搞不清楚对象
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.10,0:52:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有谁非置你于死地不可？- 我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.07,0:52:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你跟客户有纠纷吗？- 我没客户 我退休了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.11,0:52:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠军方给的退休金过日子
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.81,0:52:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的 多年来 你对我了如指掌
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.62,0:52:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有任何仇人？以前结下的梁子？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.65,0:52:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我搬来之后 过去都丢开了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.66,0:52:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的过去怎么可能丢得开
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.26,0:52:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- [法语] 局长 楼下有人找您 - 等我一下 不要离开
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.85,0:52:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妳在干什么？- 电脑无所不知
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.52,0:52:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 只要有密码 - 妳疯了？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.79,0:53:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是警察局！- 你总是不断抱怨
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.16,0:53:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有做爱时不发一语 哈罗！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.42,0:53:11.22,Note,0,0,0,0,,（宾士）
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.96,0:53:13.05,Note,0,0,0,0,,（黑色）
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.46,0:53:18.43,Note,0,0,0,0,,（摩纳哥）
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.09,0:53:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了没？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.34,0:53:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们打算住哪里？- 不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.11,0:53:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我表弟有家小旅馆
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.88,0:54:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 我们自己想办法 - 身无分文 不太容易吧
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.22,0:54:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然不多 但不至于挨饿
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.09,0:54:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.40,0:54:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妳要去哪里？- 拜访那个傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.64,0:54:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 保重 - 等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.24,0:54:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不去吗？- 不去
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.98,0:54:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但他炸掉你的车子 - 我可以再买一辆
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.05,0:54:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他烧了你的房子 - 我会重新盖过
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.75,0:54:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他想杀你！- 目前他以为他成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.99,0:54:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,劝妳一句 我不知道妳惹上谁 但想杀妳的人以为妳死了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.06,0:54:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,妳大可以重新做人 我劝妳 重新做人！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.97,0:55:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,有四百人命在旦夕 在一艘货柜船上
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.51,0:55:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.85,0:55:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我姐妹
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.12,0:55:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,船今天会抵达
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.15,0:55:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们逼我父亲当奴隶
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.29,0:55:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有那傢伙知道货柜号码
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.63,0:55:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妳很厉害哟 - 什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.93,0:55:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,从妳看到我家挂的画 你就开始设计我卷入妳的事
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.50,0:55:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,早餐啦 帮我骗过警方啦 一招接着一招
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.84,0:55:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 并非全部都是骗局 - 举个例子
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.95,0:55:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你家… 我们之间的事
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.22,0:55:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是虚情假意
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.06,0:55:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是军人 救人是你的天职
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.30,0:56:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 注意 那是过去式 - 什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.20,0:56:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,付钱请我效力的人
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.31,0:56:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不把我的努力当成一回事
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.14,0:56:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有人在乎 - 这次我在乎
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.50,0:56:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢啦
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.21,0:56:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 你好
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.01,0:56:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,半小时之内不接电话吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.05,0:56:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈罗 没想到吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.09,0:56:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,请坐
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.47,0:57:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,手放在我看得到的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.40,0:57:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,谈正事之前
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.91,0:57:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我先问个问题 你为什么要杀我？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.54,0:57:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你骗我 你开过包裹
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.61,0:57:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你破坏了自己的规矩
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.95,0:57:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要我怎么办？帮你介绍另一趟任务？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.09,0:57:30.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,船号是多少？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.39,0:57:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,快递先生 我们都同意
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.66,0:57:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我礼貌的回答了第一个问题 我不再回答任何问题
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.63,0:57:42.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我建议你现在杀了我
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.14,0:57:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后去自寻死路
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.68,0:57:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有一点线索
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.35,0:57:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怜的法兰克 她跟你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.09,0:58:02.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们用货柜载偷渡客？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.76,0:58:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我跟你说 她不愧姓「赖」 - 赖先生正在上楼
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.79,0:58:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲来了 妳怎么自圆其说
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.03,0:58:13.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妳父亲不是在货柜里？- 对 我是说 不对
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.97,0:58:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,货柜里有四百人
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.10,0:58:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 留在原地不要动！- 她让你心碎吧 法兰克？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.65,0:58:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,十秒钟 交出资料或你的人头
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.32,0:58:32.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再说我说谎吧 九 八… - 枪给我
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.29,0:58:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不懂你在说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.16,0:58:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,五…四…三…二…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.19,0:58:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 开枪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.67,0:58:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,赖
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.64,0:58:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来啊！- 我会不会杀自己的女儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.75,0:59:04.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,别闹了 枪放下
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.06,0:59:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们谈谈
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.76,0:59:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,她以为我们用货柜载偷渡客
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.90,0:59:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妳怎么会这么想？- 不要过来！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.67,0:59:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妳敢杀自己的爸爸？- 拜托
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.41,0:59:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 求你别再干了！- 我就是我
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.91,0:59:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱做什么就做什么 我不会改变的
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.28,0:59:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果妳想杀我 动手吧
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.25,0:59:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不敢杀我 不要拿枪指着我
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.56,0:59:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给我 - 不
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.36,0:59:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道他是无辜的 妳的心肠真软
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.77,0:59:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,老是想拯救无辜 给妳一次机会
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.97,1:00:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,枪丢掉 简简单单救一条命
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.28,1:00:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杀了他！- 不
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.58,1:00:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 警察正赶过来 - 怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.75,1:00:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,带她走
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.12,1:00:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫里欧过来 我要他来收拾一下
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.58,1:00:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是四百人
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.75,1:00:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,抵达时只有395人存活
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.65,1:00:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,法兰克
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.79,1:00:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 警官 幸好你及时赶来 - 怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.26,1:00:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他利用我合伙人的女儿来勒索
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.03,1:00:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好保全将他制伏
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.50,1:01:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要控告他绑架 勒索和袭击
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.14,1:01:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我认识这个人 - 职责所在
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.14,1:01:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,三教九流你都认识
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.61,1:01:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我需要请律师过来吗？- 我们可以处理
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.32,1:01:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你们全部到局里做笔录
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.82,1:01:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,连络律师之后 乐意之至
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.31,1:01:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,医生说你会头痛好几天
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.65,1:01:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 之后不会有什么大碍 - 他们呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.89,1:01:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该多关心自己的处境吧
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.83,1:02:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底怎么回事？你出奇的谨慎
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.00,1:02:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我得离开这里 - 他们控告你的罪名
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.33,1:02:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,足以让你关上好一阵子
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.24,1:02:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,袭击优良国贸组织会员
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.24,1:02:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,绑架他女儿 以及勒索
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.74,1:02:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 法兰克 我也想帮你
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.88,1:02:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是如果你还是那套老调 声称「我退休了 靠退休金…」
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.26,1:02:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,给点新说法 法兰克 新版本
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.93,1:02:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,总得跟我说一次实话
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.43,1:02:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 他们是人蛇集团
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.37,1:02:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,从亚洲走私到马赛 用货柜
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.07,1:02:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说的是事实吗？- 那女孩说的
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.61,1:02:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你相信她？- 嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.88,1:02:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,法国有句俗话 厨子不可信
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.05,1:03:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她不是厨师 - 我早就心存怀疑
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.06,1:03:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 法兰克 人都会犯错 - 你是说 你不采取任何行动？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.59,1:03:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会展开调查
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.60,1:03:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时 货柜里的四百人全死了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.60,1:03:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该怎么办？这里有法律的
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.64,1:03:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有时你得自己自创法律 - 跟你一样？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.41,1:03:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少不用浪费一整年时间
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.74,1:03:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我懂你的意思 所以我很羡慕你
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.78,1:03:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,军事训练 偷偷摸摸的技巧
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.78,1:03:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这个案子交给你处理 需要多久？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.52,1:03:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 12小时？- 更快
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.76,1:03:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,更快？了不起
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.43,1:03:43.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是最适合的人选
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.76,1:03:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 如果我出得去的话 - 没错 只要你出得去
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.89,1:04:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,轻举妄动我就杀了他
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.66,1:04:53.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果都用这种方法送快递 我很怀疑你怎么有生意
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.27,1:04:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,来帮个忙
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.28,1:05:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 或许我该跟你去 - 谢了 但我喜欢单兵出击
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.35,1:05:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,应付大场面 这船未免太小了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.22,1:05:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是它是艘好船
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.02,1:05:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,法兰克 拿去
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.06,1:05:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会用得上的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.80,1:05:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你不需要
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.55,1:06:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,货物齐全 这是相关文件
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.29,1:07:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,一路走高速公路到里昂出口
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.19,1:07:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后直接送进仓库 我们跟在后面以防万一
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.88,1:07:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以出发了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.59,1:07:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.20,1:07:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我花大把钞票让妳学英语
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.40,1:07:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 至少妳可以用英文跟我说话吧 - 我恨你
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.68,1:07:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一样还是你爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.85,1:07:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,押她出去！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.04,1:08:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我一下
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.93,1:08:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要杀死他
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.54,1:09:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.60,1:10:30.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不要开枪！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.11,1:10:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,走
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.46,1:17:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.77,1:17:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,早
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.44,1:17:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想看看风景 - 这不是观光飞机
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.68,1:17:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不是观光客
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.04,1:18:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,连络这个人 请他跟我碰面 塔科尼警官 马赛警局
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.41,1:18:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.38,1:18:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在底下
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.51,1:18:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那里！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.26,1:19:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,超过去！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.76,1:20:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好机会！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.13,1:22:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠近一点
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.54,1:22:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 稳住！- 爸 不要！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.61,1:22:22.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚开！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.83,1:23:50.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,下车！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.65,1:24:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,手放在头上！走！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.02,1:24:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着她 如果她乱来 或我没回来 就杀了她
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.26,1:24:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 往水边走 - 我没心情游泳
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.83,1:24:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.67,1:24:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这人渣怎么搭上我女儿？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.04,1:24:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不是把她扔在一个袋子里？- 你懂个屁！走！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.78,1:24:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,钓马子也得搞清楚状况 白痴
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.72,1:24:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会顺利交货 她会忘掉这些不愉快
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.25,1:24:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好运的话 她会回心转意
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.26,1:24:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好运的话 她干脆被车撞死
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.97,1:24:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你懂什么？- 我知道她不会改变心意
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.74,1:24:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,她永远不会跟你一样
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.97,1:25:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会回心转意 可惜你看不到
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.78,1:25:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.65,1:25:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能连回心转意的机会都没了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.99,1:25:22.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 转过来！- 我宁可吃子弹
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.96,1:25:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正我无所谓
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.52,1:25:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个大坏蛋 可是 他是我的父亲
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.21,1:26:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间掌握得真精准 法兰克
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.15,1:26:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我低估了你
